WEBVTT

00:12:27.143 --> 00:12:31.175
if we all begin our journey today --

00:12:31.199 --> 00:12:33.215
not tomorrow -- today.

00:12:33.614 --> 00:12:38.377
Because the future is built today,

00:12:38.401 --> 00:12:43.044
and it is not built in isolation,

00:12:43.068 --> 00:12:46.542
but rather in community and in harmony.

00:12:47.529 --> 00:12:49.054
Thank you.